==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Beastly Nero (Enemy)|Beastly Nero]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Super Devil (Enemy)|Super Devil]] spawns.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is weak to aggressive play, while some of the enemies are powerful when magnified elsewhere they are not here due to their damage being too low to prevent stacks from accruing in blindspots or even in their line of fire, and their support does not make up for them. Any quick attackers will be able to invade the range of everyh=thing here and kill them, but [[Anti-Red Cats]], especially [[Courier Cat]], make this process much easier and quicker.

